RiskAssessment
if
    creditScore s about 650.0 cosineNot incomeLevel are generally high meanAnd
    debtRatio s below 0.4 meanOr collateralValue are closeTo 1.2 productAnd
    employmentYears s should 3.0 productOr age are around 40.0 sugenoNot
    savings s not increased thresholdNot expenses are positively low yagerAnd
    creditHistory s definitely strong yagerNot latePayments are negative 2.0
    yagerOr region s inVicinityOf reference
then
    approval s increased
else
    approval s decreased
;
